<refnamediv>
  <refname><function>SilikoNodeCreateFromValue</function></refname>
  <refpurpose>Function to create a leaf node with a specified value</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Node.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">SilikoNode *SilikoNodeCreateFromValue(SilikoValue *source);</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The <function>SilikoNodeCreateFromValue</function> function
generates a new leaf node from <varname>source</varname>. The value
in <varname>source</varname> is copied, and the calling context is
responsible for managing <varname>source</varname> after a call to
<function>SilikoNodeCreateFromValue</function>.</para>
</refsection>

<refsection>
<title>Return Values</title>

<para><function>SilikoNodeCreateFromValue</function> returns a pointer
to a new leaf <type>SilikoNode</type> object with a copy of the value
passed on success, or <literal>NULL</literal> if there was a memory
error.</para>
</refsection>
